  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Experience running bliss with the ASICS GEL-1130. Spanning decades of design evolution, these innovation-led sneakers enhance your high-impact strides while paying homage to the ninth iteration of the GEL-1000 series. Powered by a mesh upper that provides a cool sensation, these reimagined silhouettes are true masterpieces that make each run a celebration of your passion. The repurposed traditional materials with suede paneling evolve these shoes for a more modern aesthetic. The GEL technology in the heel lets you log those long hours of runs with excellent shock absorption and cushioning. Your secret to comfort-fueled running victories, the ASICS GEL-1130 lets you unlock your true potential.</p> <p><strong>ASICS GEL-1130 </strong><strong>features: </strong></p> <ul> <li>EVA midsole adds soft cushioning.</li> <li>TRUSSTIC support system nods to the late 2000s design and improves stability.</li> <li>Off-white hues on the tooling offer a vintage-inspired aesthetic.</li> <li>Construction inspired by GEL-KAYANO 14 sneakers provides classic comfort.</li> <li>Rubber outsole delivers traction.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Long days on your feet call for comfort that feels supportive from the start. Rooted in ASICS’ late-2000s running design language, the GEL-1130 blends breathable comfort, everyday cushioning, and a clean retro look that fits right into your daily rotation. It is an easy pick for work, weekends, and anywhere you want a little extra stability underfoot.</p><ul><li>Breathable mesh upper with layered overlays for a structured feel</li><li>GEL technology in the heel helps absorb impact</li><li>EVA midsole adds soft cushioning</li><li>TRUSSTIC support system helps enhance stability</li><li>Design inspired by the GEL-KAYANO 14</li><li>Rubber outsole provides reliable traction</li></ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>Reviewers often describe this pair as comfortable and true to size. For the best fit, we recommend starting with your usual size if you want a supportive feel for all-day wear.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for everyday wear, long hours on your feet, and casual routines that benefit from lightweight comfort and stability.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p><p>With its retro running-inspired shape, open mesh build, and layered ASICS side stripes, this sneaker brings sporty heritage to everything from leggings and joggers to denim and relaxed tailoring. It is easy to dress up or down, making it a strong everyday option when you want comfort without giving up style.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-1130 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Cream/Pink Cloud</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203A899-105</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <su